- `scripts/research_skylit_r2_exposure_decomposition.py`
- existing registered owner suite `tests/test_options_gap_discipline.py`

The temporary standalone research test was removed after contract-delta correctly refused an unregistered suite. No `legacy-jobs.yml` edit and no waiver were used.

Intentionally untouched:
